BONUS QUESTION

Machine Learning Workflow:

Data
 ↓
Training
 ↓
Model
 ↓
Prediction

Explanation: 
data- collects the requirted data
training- data is given to ML. model learns the relationship between input and output
model- it contains the pattern and relationships it learned
prediction- according to the data it learned, the model is going to predict output for new or unseen data.